sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant App as FireFly App
    participant IDP as Identity Provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Databricks as Databricks APIs

    rect rgb(34, 197, 94)
        Note over User,IDP: OAuth 2.0 + PKCE Authentication
        User->>App: Login Request
        App->>App: Generate PKCE Code Verifier
        App->>App: Create Code Challenge (SHA-256)
        App->>IDP: Redirect with Code Challenge
        IDP->>User: SSO Login Page
        User->>IDP: Credentials
        IDP->>App: Authorization Code
        App->>IDP: Exchange Code + Verifier
        IDP->>App: ID Token + Access Token
    end

    rect rgb(59, 130, 246)
        Note over App,DB: Secure Session Creation
        App->>App: Validate ID Token
        App->>App: Extract User Claims
        App->>DB: Create/Update User
        App->>App: Generate Session Token (32 bytes)
        App->>DB: Store Session (encrypted)
        App->>User: Set HttpOnly Cookie
    end

    rect rgb(249, 115, 22)
        Note over App,Databricks: API Request Flow
        User->>App: API Request + Session Cookie
        App->>DB: Validate Session
        DB->>App: User + Organization Context
        App->>DB: Get Encrypted SPN Credentials
        App->>App: Decrypt SPN Secret
        App->>Databricks: API Call with SPN Token
        Databricks->>App: Response
        App->>User: Data
    end
